factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The reel_script says the road is 'கரடுமுரடாக கிடக்கிறது' (rough/uneven) right at the start; the article's headline uses this framing but the body describes loose gravel and dust, so the phrasing 'பாதியில் கரடுமுரடாக கிடக்கிறது' is grammatically awkward and mixes the headline with the body's facts.
  The reel_script states the road was dug 'for repair' and that the halted work is the cause of the condition, while the article says the road was dug for drainage/water-pipe work and then earlier repairs; the reel mixes these two reasons in one sentence ('பாதாள சாக்கடை, குடிநீர் திட்டப் பணிகளுக்காக இந்தச் சாலை ஏற்கனவே பலமுறை தோண்டப்பட்டது') without clearly separating the earlier digging from the current halted repair.
  The reel_script's 'பணி ஏன் நிற்கிறது' explanation attributes the halt to the electric cable and bus-stop works, but the article only says these works are ongoing and that road repair will follow after they finish; the reel presents these as the reason the work stopped, which the article does not state.
  The reel_script omits the important fact that the road repair will begin after the pending works finish, and that work is promised within one week is included, but the reel fails to clearly convey that the road surface scraping was the halted work itself.
